                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} diag
                at
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Atiyah+Lie+groupoid"} Atiyah Lie groupoid
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs
                \:
              %ul
                %li
                  %p
                    started
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connection+on+a+bundle"} connection on a bundle
                    in reply to discussion
                    %a{:href => "http://sbseminar.wordpress.com/2009/05/28/local-systems-what-do-you-know-about-connections/#comment-5791"} here
                %li
                  %p
                    added to
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/distributor"} distributor
                    the description in terms of colimit preserving functors on presheaf categories and added corresponding remarks at the beginning of
